OL,3,GNEWSALost document uncovers true story
OL,4,Aof 'hero' who led infamous revolt
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew evidence has uncovered what
OL,7,Fhappened next to a man who led a
OL,8,Fworkers' revolt in south Wales almost
OL,9,F200 years ago.
OL,11,FLewis Lewis, or Lewsyn yr Heliwr, was
OL,12,Fdescribed as a "hero" for his role in
OL,13,Fthe Merthyr Rising of 1831, when
OL,14,Fworkers protested over low wages.
OL,16,FAnother who became well known for his
OL,17,Frole in the uprising was Dic Penderyn,
OL,18,Fwho was later executed.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
