OL,3,GNEWSALost document uncovers true story
OL,4,Aof 'hero' who led infamous revolt
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut little was previously known about
OL,7,FLewis' later life, other than his
OL,8,Fdeportation to Australia, until the
OL,9,Frecent discovery of a "misfiled"
OL,10,Fdocument.
